  "description": "Skia-backed ISvgRasterizer companion for ToolUp.OpenXml — renders an SVG figure to PNG bytes so the emitted .docx can carry a raster fallback part alongside the native svgBlip vector part, for Office clients that predate the 2016 SVG extension. Opt-in: ToolUp.OpenXml itself carries no rendering engine and no native dependency, and a document emitted without this companion embeds SVG-only rather than failing.",
